 through a fantasy landscape.\"\n\n\"Next Scene: The camera tracks forward and tilts down, bringing the sun and helicopters closer into frame as a strong lens flare intensifies.\"\n\n\"Next Scene: The camera pans right, removing the dragon and rider from view while revealing more of the floating mountain range in the distance.\"", 0.6, 2028, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image", "link": 106, "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_baseurl"}, "name": "api_baseurl", "label": "api_baseurl", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_baseurl"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_key"}, "name": "api_key", "label": "api_key", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_key"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 80, "type": "RH_LLMAPI_NODE", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_LLMAPI_NODE"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [140, 526], "pos": [2641.052978515625, 228.18870544433594], "widgets_values": ["Next Scene: The camera begins with a slow dolly-in, focusing on the glowing candle and melted wax on the wooden floor. Tiny flickers of light float upward, hinting at something magical in the air.", "Next Scene: The camera pans upward to reveal the girl’s hands delicately holding a small matchstick, the flame casting warm shadows across her face and her polka-dot pajamas.", "Next Scene: A soft push-in reveals a faint shimmer around the girl, her hair catching the light as the glowing specks slowly multiply and swirl around her.", "Next Scene: The camera tilts up to the window, revealing the night sky, dotted with stars. A faint, glowing trail of light moves across the sky, as if responding to the magic in the room.", "Next Scene: The shot transitions into a wide frame, revealing more of the room. The stuffed animal in the corner begins to twitch slightly, as though coming to life.", "Next Scene: A tracking shot follows the glowing specks as they swirl around the room, illuminating drawings on the walls and casting playful shadows across the furniture.", "Next Scene: The camera pulls back to show the girl standing now, her gaze fixed on the stuffed animal that has begun to move, its fur shimmering under the magical light.", "Next Scene: A close-up reveals the stuffed animal’s face, its button eyes blinking slowly as it stretches its small limbs, seemingly awakening.", "Next Scene: The camera pans toward the bed, where a faint glow emanates from underneath. The girl crouches down and lifts the blanket, revealing a hidden treasure chest glowing softly.", "Next Scene: The camera zooms in on the girl’s hands as she opens the chest, releasing a burst of radiant light that fills the room and causes the floating specks to dance wildly."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 108, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 82, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [105, 106], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [274.080078125, 314.00006103515625], "pos": [544.0803833007812, 1034.790283203125], "widgets_values